      "get": {
        "operationId": "team-summary",
        "summary": "Per-game team report for one franchise, one row per game",
        "description": "`league`, `season` and `franchise_id` are all required, and restish takes them as positional\narguments in that order — `restish pff team-summary nfl 2024 14` (franchise ids come from\n`team-list`). One row per game rather than per team, so a range of weeks gives a game-by-game line;\n`--week` narrows it. Grades are on PFF's 0-100 scale and every other column is a raw total or rate;\nwhich columns come back depends on the league, the query and the caller's entitlement.",
        "tags": [
