        "operationId": "player-seasons",
        "summary": "List the seasons a player has data for",
        "description": "`league` and `player` are required, and restish takes them as positional arguments in that order —\n`restish pff player-seasons nfl 4924`. The seasons a player can be asked about, so a client can\noffer a season picker rather than guess. `--season` and `--week` are accepted and make no\ndifference: the answer is the player's whole history either way.\n\nReturns the raw upstream payload — no report envelope.",
        "tags": [
