</svg></div></div><nav style="height:0px" class="faq-body w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-body-cont"><p class="faq-answer">Absolutely! Pikkit is designed to accommodate all types of sports bets, whether you wager on individual games, parlays, teasers, or any other bet types. Our app supports various sports leagues and events, ensuring you can track your bets across a wide range of sports.</p></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" data-w-id="4b98f07c-6179-b7ea-a1ec-f61a58dc943b" class="faq-p w-dropdown"><div class="faq w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body_22 title">Is Pikkit free to use?</div><div class="arrow_ic w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="auto" height="auto" viewBox="0 0 16 18" fill="none">
