</svg></div></div><nav style="height:0px" class="faq-body w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-body-cont"><p class="faq-answer">Yes! In fact, we have a referrer program in the app that allows you to make money by referring friends. Download for free today!<br/><br/>We also offer premium features within our Pikkit Pro subscription. See what is available <a href="/pro" class="link-4">here</a>. <br/></p></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" data-w-id="611c553c-735f-6e5c-52c0-de542e389388" class="faq-p w-dropdown"><div class="faq w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body_22 title">Is my data secure on Pikkit?</div><div class="arrow_ic w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="18" viewBox="0 0 16 18" fill="none">
  <path d="M9 1C9 0.447715 8.55228 2.41411e-08 8 0C7.44772 -2.41411e-08 7 0.447715 7 1L9 1ZM7.29289 17.7071C7.68342 18.0976 8.31658 18.0976 8.70711 17.7071L15.0711 11.3431C15.4616 10.9526 15.4616 10.3195 15.0711 9.92893C14.6805 9.53841 14.0474 9.53841 13.6569 9.92893L8 15.5858L2.34315 9.92893C1.95262 9.53841 1.31946 9.53841 0.928932 9.92893C0.538407 10.3195 0.538407 10.9526 0.928932 11.3431L7.29289 17.7071ZM7 1L7 17L9 17L9 1L7 1Z" fill="currentcolor"/>
</svg></div></div><nav style="height:0px" class="faq-body w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-body-cont"><p class="faq-answer">At Pikkit, our business model - and our reputation - depend on keeping your information safe. We go above and beyond in the following ways:<br/>- Account credentials are stored locally with the help of system keychain (Apple Keychain/Credential Vault), similar to how a browser stores your passwords.<br/>- Your information is never sold to anyone.<br/>- Your information is end-to-end encrypted to our servers.<br/>- Around-the-clock monitoring protects your information.<br/><br/>Rest assured that your data is securely stored and only accessible to you.</p></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" data-w-id="8eede887-6698-6a98-6d5d-4ac5bdd40bf8" class="faq-p w-dropdown"><div class="faq w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body_22 title">Do you support manual bets?</div><div class="arrow_ic w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="18" viewBox="0 0 16 18" fill="none">
