</svg></div></div><nav style="height:0px" class="faq-body w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-body-cont"><p class="faq-answer">No, Pikkit does not support manual bet entry and only support syncing bets from sportsbooks at this time. This allows our users to trust that all statistics are verified on the platform.</p></div></nav></div><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" data-w-id="1c3dcea5-d62e-b154-aa67-bb7e61263487" class="faq-p w-dropdown"><div class="faq w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="body_22 title">Can I hide my bets so other people can’t see them?</div><div class="arrow_ic w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="18" viewBox="0 0 16 18" fill="none">
